Per the FCC docs... ([https://4pda.to/forum/index.php?showtopic=1016804 Spec.]) *This device is using a [[Broadcom]] BCM43131T (BCM43131TKMLG) :[[Tenda]] W150D V3.0 • CPU: BCMB63281, Flash: MX25L3205 (4MB)
*The power adapter shown in the FCC external photos is a :''Shenzhen Heweishun Network Technology Co., Ltd.'' :TEA09U-09100 (100-240VAC ~50/60Hz, 0.3A -> 9VDC 1A)
